{"id":"15.12.island3d","contentHtml":"<p>This project marks my <strong>first step into C# programming</strong>.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Instead of doing a <strong>standard educational project</strong>, I decided to immediately apply new knowledge to create a unique gaming experience.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2>Challenge</h2>\n<p>As my <strong>first C# project</strong>, I set myself a creative challenge: not to make a standard menu, but to <strong>design and program a fully diegetic UI</strong>, where menu items are interactive 3D objects in the game world.</p>\n<h2>Engineering and Creative Solution</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Diegetic UI:</strong> Menu items are implemented as <strong>3D objects (crates) in the scene</strong>. On hover, the crate <strong>starts emitting dynamic light</strong>; on click — logic is processed.</li>\n<li><strong>Cinematic Transitions:</strong> Menu navigation is implemented through <strong>programmatic camera animation control</strong> for \"flights\" between sections.</li>\n<li><strong>Full Demo Implementation:</strong> Within the project, I implemented all key functions from scratch: <strong>loading a game level</strong>, <strong>changing graphics settings</strong>, world setup (<code>Terrain</code>, day/night cycle), and first-person character integration.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Outcome</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>First C# Prototype Created:</strong> Successfully implemented a playable prototype with a unique concept, <strong>instantly turning theoretical C# knowledge into a working product</strong>.</li>\n<li><strong>Demonstration of Creative Approach:</strong> The project proves that <mark>even at the very start of my programming journey, I strove to create not standard, but unique and memorable solutions</mark>.</li>\n</ul>\n","published":true,"title":"Island 3d","date":"2015-12","type":"project","tagsArray":["PC","Unity","C#"],"heroVideo":["9AX8WQOMbjs"],"shortDescription":"<p>My debut in C# programming: <mark>immediately after learning the basics</mark>, created a fully diegetic 3D interface from scratch.</p>\n","role":"solo","projectIcon":"/images/projects/15.12.island3d/icon.webp","cardBackground":"/images/projects/15.12.island3d/card.mp4?v=1765047036928","screenshots":[{"src":"/images/projects/15.12.island3d/screenshots/1.webp","width":1188,"height":668},{"src":"/images/projects/15.12.island3d/screenshots/2.webp","width":1188,"height":668},{"src":"/images/projects/15.12.island3d/screenshots/3.webp","width":1188,"height":668}]}